ur=200&s=69f6c6e897026a95d5ad0aa27ef0cd77, https://si.imgix.net/353d9225/uploads/origins/a8bd7b81-4d98-4ec0-97ff-e9dc77df159c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bb79f3dd07c89e4304af55fd938850a1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/353d9225/uploads/origins/a8bd7b81-4d98-4ec0-97ff-e9dc77df159c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f057cd645ce99114ca1c5e85b571f62 3x"}, "body": "Hi! Your art is so amazing and I would love to have you draw my VTuber character. The composition is up to you, but can you make them look handsome and cool.\n\nI would like to share your art on SNS while crediting you. I look forward to seeing it!\n\nReference: https://twitter.com/BubbyButtVT/status/1529797613213700096/photo/1\nReference: https://twitter.com/BubbyButtVT/status/1528380743801573378/photo/1", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1947451, "client_id": 771268, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd2e93d0660752cd03cf285b337a5a35", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd2e93d0660752cd03cf285b337a5a35, https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e4db7824c9a5ad86e9acd26f8168efc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77862b24b537104f90e12f1de64fa826 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a3fd8c96911ce7da28e89983f3b59e56", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a3fd8c96911ce7da28e89983f3b59e56, https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3225286dc8862b0985956b11fac65c88 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f5028f0c4c1cbd9e61b85b086cecee1a 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、私の名前はナナミンです。 私はあなたの絵が大好きなので、是非私と妹のキャラクター全身イラストを描いてもらいたいです!　ポーズと表情はお任せします。\n\nナナミン：\n身長は１６０ｃｍ\n意地悪で、大切な人達以外どうでもいい\n感情がよく分からないのでいつも無表情\n退屈が大嫌いで共感ができない\n負の感情から生まれた彼女は負の感情に惹かれる\n魔法がめちゃくちゃ強いです\n悪魔の姿を描いてください。\n\nMyste：\n身長は１６６ｃｍ\n性格は冷静でクール。\n種族はエルフ。\n彼女は研究員です、アノマリーリサーチャーです。\n\n差し支えなければ、私のSNSやサムネイルに使用したいので、できればレイヤーを分けていただけないでしょうか。\n承諾していただけると嬉しいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1V1K3U_OHUzEl0Khsb_A4Jec0_ur6A4m5?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1947451, "client_id": 1188917, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=453ad66fbecd7d6b725da98ebd663b9b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=453ad66fbecd7d6b725da98ebd663b9b, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f87aaaeb4582cbaee7a680e428c56857 2x, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21f4c072457cb517b62a3f2321a3bac2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f0eef30b67731ccf0a5ecff50f99abdb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f0eef30b67731ccf0a5ecff50f99abdb, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2b12290b1a93729fde474168c0f34b10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e068588fe1f1a2ce5ff93d50db28dd17 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Nice to meet you, I adore your art style. I'd like for you to draw my character.\n\n▶Character A (183cm):\nA handsome young detective with a somewhat violent streak. Outwardly a mild-mannered gentleman, his job is to track down spies who have fled from various organizations. He uses binding cords as well as handcuffs for his captors. Broad shoulders. Feel free to draw him with or without the coat, simplifying the details of his outfit is OK. His motifs are \"spider lilies\", \"fireworks\", \"foggy city\" and \"red cords\". Please note the details in the URL.\n\n▶Request details\nPlease draw him looking cool! I leave the pose and composition up to you, however some suggestions for it would be: smoking from a tobacco pipe or kiseru, wiping blood from his face, or adjusting his gloves.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/221k4jpv7mvc", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1947451, "client_id": 1813672, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=337e7394894ac3e5a192f4675ca79188", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=337e7394894ac3e5a192f4675ca79188, https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=273ba7e1c347dfbf233075f07ab789ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74ad66d6bff03262b76d66f6a06f87cb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d813db2cce551ec76f9aa7a005af9224", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d813db2cce551ec76f9aa7a005af9224, https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=210